	optdepends = steam: registers the runtime as a Steam compatibility tool, and provides the STEAM_COMPAT_CLIENT_INSTALL_PATH Proton expects
	optdepends = ferestre-git: the front end that actually launches titles with this runtime
	optdepends = libcups: printing from a title (localspl.so, winspool.so)
	optdepends = v4l-utils: webcam capture (qcap.so)
	optdepends = libgcrypt: alternative crypto backend for bcrypt.so
	optdepends = nettle3: HLS streaming in the bundled GStreamer -- AUR, because Arch ships libnettle.so.9 and the plugin wants .so.8
